# W30b, host a (k10): hosts Dry Land, first only stag0201 and dng205b1; after b's first arrival at dng205b2 it goes on to
# dng205b2. The ways on are the depart action with the exits' own targets (stag0202's matz01: dng205b1 point 0;
# dng205b1's matz02: dng205b2 point 0), a alone in its stage group.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@80
explore mate00 until onme:mate00
gate mate00 1 until stage=stag0201,control
log a hosts Dry Land
depart dng205b1 0 until stage=dng205b1,control
log a in dng205b1
fight until epoch>=@420
depart dng205b2 0 until stage=dng205b2,control
log a in dng205b2
fight until present=2,sealed>=600 or epoch>=@800
log b joined a in B2
